    {
      "parameters": {"content": "# 💰 O7 · AGENCY FINANCE BRAIN (27 sub-automations)\n**RETAINERS monthly 1st 08:30 (7):** ① due-retainer detection from Retainers tab ② Razorpay payment link per client ③ Zoho Books invoice ④ one-tap send message ⑤ renewal-date warnings T-15 ⑥ price-revision reminder yearly ⑦ pause/churn flag.\n**CHASING daily 10:15 (6):** ⑧ unpaid D+3 gentle chase ⑨ D+7 firmer ⑩ D+14 owner call task ⑪ paid-detection via Razorpay ⑫ receipt thank-you ⑬ aging summary weekly.\n**PROFITABILITY Fri 17:00 (7):** ⑭ revenue per client (Retainers+extras) ⑮ hours/tasks per client (from O3 Tasks) ⑯ tool-cost allocation (ToolCosts tab) ⑰ effective margin per client ⑱ loss-making client flag ⑲ price-increase candidates ⑳ founder P&L snapshot.\n**EXPENSE & TOOLS (7):** ㉑ `#expense amount/what` via Telegram → Expenses tab ㉒ monthly tool-subscription audit (unused = cancel candidates) ㉓ burn rate ㉔ runway estimate ㉕ GST-due reminder (11th/20th) ㉖ TDS note on big vendor payments ㉗ month-end books-close checklist.\n\n**KEYS:** Razorpay basic-auth · Zoho OAuth + ZB_ORG_ID · GEMINI_API_KEY · TG_OSPYR_CHAT · OSPYR_SHEET_ID (tabs: Retainers[Client,Amount,DueDay,Status,LastPaid], Expenses, ToolCosts[Tool,Monthly,UsedFor]).\n**FIX:** double invoices → LastPaid month guard; wrong margins → allocate ToolCosts.UsedFor per client.", "height": 600, "width": 570},
      "id": "n0", "name": "README", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-630, -280]
    },
    {"parameters": {"rule": {"interval": [{"field": "cronExpression", "expression": "30 8 1 * *"}]}}, "id": "r1", "name": "R1 1st 8:30 retainers", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [0, -120]},
    {"parameters": {"documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_OSPYR_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "Retainers", "mode": "name"}, "options": {}}, "id": "r2", "name": "R2 read retainers", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [180, -120], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
